{"id":"msg_m_ex_infinityrail_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_infinityrail","label":"Infinity Rail · Group"},"label":"4. So...","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_mainafter_13_02","next":"msg_m_ex_infinityrail_04","speakers":{"soline_w":"Soline","diesel_w":"Diesel","brid_w":"Brid"},"icons":{"soline_w":"si_c074_00_s","diesel_w":"si_c075_00_s","brid_w":"si_c073_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_1","text":"So...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_2","text":"I've been thinking...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_3","text":"Hehehehehehehehehe!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_4","text":"About what?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_5","text":"The outfits we got","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_6","text":"all look great on everyone,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_7","text":"but c'mon, mine's obviously the best, right?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_8","text":"It is pretty!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_9","text":"Veeerrry pretty, actually! ^.^","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_10","text":"But mine's not too shabby either, you know!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_11","text":"The knot at the waist keeps everything nicely balanced,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_12","text":"the ribbon in my hair adds a cute little pop that matches the outfit,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_13","text":"and the strawberry badge? It's just adorable!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_14","text":"I completely agree.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_15","text":"My outfit does stand out for its clean, polished look.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_16","text":"That's what I like most about it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_17","text":"That clean black-and-white look suits you so well, Brid!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_18","text":"Mine too!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_19","text":"The sky-blue really pops, doesn't it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_20","text":"Wearing it makes me feel like I'm zooming with our AZX!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_21","text":"It sure does!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_22","text":"That outfit suits your cuteness perfectly!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_23","text":"But you know, I still think mine looks the prettiest!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_24","text":"As I see it, my outfit looks the best.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_25","text":"Hey, I said that first!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_26","text":"They're all pretty, but mine's definitely the best.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_27","text":"Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_28","text":"What do you think?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_29","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_29","text":"Diesel's outfit is the best.","jump":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_32"},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_30","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_30","text":"Yeah, it's gotta be Soline's.","jump":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_38"},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_31","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_31","text":"Brid's outfit isn't bad either.","jump":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_43"},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_32","text":"Thank you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_33","text":"I knew you'd think so too!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_34","text":"Hmph! That's only because you haven't really looked at my outfit properly, Commander!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_35","text":"Wait right there,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_36","text":"I'm coming over to show you right now!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_37","text":"Agreed.","jump":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_47"},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_38","text":"I knew you've got good taste!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_39","text":"My outfit's obviously the best!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_40","text":"I find that hard to accept.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_41","text":"I will come to you, Commander, so please take another look.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_42","text":"Then I'll come along too and show you again.","jump":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_47"},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_43","text":"Thank you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_44","text":"I can always rely on the Commander's judgment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_45","text":"Oh, that's a bit unexpected!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_46","text":"Maybe your answer would change if you took another look?","jump":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_47"},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"diesel_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_47","text":"I think it'd be best if I showed it to you in person again!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_48","text":"Yeah!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"soline_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_49","text":"Let's go right now!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_50","text":"Please wait a moment.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"brid_w","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_51","text":"I'll head there as soon as I'm ready.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_52","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_52","text":"Guys?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_53","text":"Wait,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_infinityrail_03_54","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_infinityrail_03_54","text":"you're really coming now?","jump":null}],"chat":true}